<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's ICP shares debut at 4.70 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's ICP shares debut at 4.70 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Industrial Concrete Products Bhd (ICP) made their market debut at 4.70 ringgit against an offer price of 3.0 ringgit.</p>
<p>The manufacturer of spun concrete piles sold 10.2 million new shares at 3.0 ringgit each in its initial public offering.  </p>
<p>Shortly after opening, the stock rose further to trade at 5.30 ringgit each on volume of 448,000 shares.</p>
<p>ICP projected net earnings per share of 9.18 cents for the year ended June 30, 1997.</p>
</text>
